WEBVTT

00:06:57.996 --> 00:07:02.196
of oil, gas and coal
in existing projects to use

00:07:02.196 --> 00:07:05.236
while we carefully manage a phasedown.

00:07:06.116 --> 00:07:11.156
And so the world is spending
its intellectual,

00:07:11.156 --> 00:07:14.876
its financial, its technical capital

00:07:14.876 --> 00:07:19.676
to dig up stuff
that we know we can't burn,

00:07:19.716 --> 00:07:22.436
and if we do, it will burn us.

00:07:24.236 --> 00:07:25.796
So what do we do?

00:07:26.676 --> 00:07:30.516
A year ago, a group
of academics, advocates,